msgid "Calindori"
msgstr "Calindori"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.calindori.appdata.xml:15
msgid "Calendar application"
msgstr "Kalendar"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.calindori.appdata.xml:17
msgid "Calindori is a touch friendly calendar application. It has been designed for mobile devices but it can also run on desktop environments. Users of Calindori are able to check previous and future dates and manage tasks and events."
msgstr "Calindori je kalendarska aplikacija prilagođena dodiru. Osmišljena je za mobilne uređaje, ali može raditi i u okruženjima radne površine. Korisnici Calindorija mogu pregledavati prošle i buduće datume te upravljati zadacima i događajima."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.calindori.appdata.xml:18
msgid "When executing the application for the first time, a new calendar file is created that follows the ical standard. Alternatively, users may create additional calendars or import existing ones."
msgstr "Pri prvom pokretanju aplikacije stvara se nova datoteka kalendara u skladu sa standardom iCalendar. Korisnici mogu stvoriti dodatne kalendare ili uvesti postojeće."

